UPDATE companies SET description='Innovative Sensor Technology (IST) USA Division operates from Las Vegas, Nevada, established in 2001 as the American sales and support arm of the Swiss sensor manufacturer IST AG. The U.S. office provides local supply-chain programs and technical support from on-site stock.

