UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Stuart, Virginia, Insight Textiles operates as part of Apex Mills, a company founded in 1943 on Long Island, New York. Originally a reseller to the bridal and apparel industries, the business evolved into a manufacturer of warp‑knit technical textiles. The corporate office remains in Inwood, New York, with production facilities in Graham, North Carolina, and Woolwine, Virginia.

