UPDATE companies SET description='Iron Designs operates from Albuquerque, New Mexico, where it designs and fabricates custom ironwork for residential and commercial properties. The company does not publish a founding year or ownership details, but its team emphasizes years of experience in metal fabrication.

The shop produces custom iron gates — including driveway, sliding, single, and double gates — as well as window grills, screen doors, storm doors, sliding door security, fencing and topper panels, stair railings, carports, and porch enclosures. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume are disclosed.

Iron Designs serves homeowners and commercial property owners across central and western New Mexico, including Albuquerque, Rio Rancho, Santa Fe, Bernalillo, Los Lunas, Belen, and Gallup. Projects range from residential driveway gates and window guards to commercial security gates and porch enclosures.

