UPDATE companies SET description='JL Woodworks, LLC was founded in 2016 in Prairieville, Louisiana. The company is locally owned and operated, established out of a passion for hands-on work and serving customers in the greater Baton Rouge area. Since its inception, the team has focused on bringing client ideas to life through a blend of design expertise and craftsmanship.

The shop specializes in custom cabinetry and woodworking, producing built-ins, mudroom systems, closets, kitchen and bathroom remodels, custom dining tables, desks, shelving, and smaller items such as cutting boards and wooden gifts. It also provides 3D rendering services to help clients visualize design and remodeling projects before fabrication begins.

The company works directly with clients to translate building plans or ideas into finished wood products, offering a range of services from initial design through final installation.

