UPDATE companies SET description='JTB Furniture, LLC operates from Columbus, Mississippi, where it has manufactured casegoods for the hospitality industry for over 90 years. The company describes itself as a proud manufacturer of casegoods for the Hilton brand of hotels, though a specific founding year and ownership structure are not disclosed.

