UPDATE companies SET description='Jim Coleman Wholesale Parts operates from Bethesda, Maryland, as the parts division of Jim Coleman Automotive, a dealership group the Coleman family founded in 1952. The business began as a single dealership and has grown to serve the Greater Washington, D.C. area from locations in Bethesda, Silver Spring, Clarksville, and Ellicott City, remaining family-owned throughout its history.

